+# F1.4 — Modular Foundation Kit
+
+Date: 2026-11-14 · Base commit: `a316f53`
+
+## Scope delivered
+
+- `foundation/core` planned manifest for future shared contracts.
+- `foundation/ui` beta addon with reusable Material 3 Compose components:
+  `AppLoading`, `AppEmptyState`, `AppErrorState`, `AppSectionHeader`,
+  `AppInfoCard`, `AppFormField`, `AppConfirmationDialog`.
+- Foundation components use existing design tokens and are independent of Room,
+  Navigation and storage.
+- Web catalog grouping includes Foundation.
+
+## Validation
+
+| Check | Result |
+| --- | --- |
+| `bun run typecheck` | PASS |
+| `bun test packages tests` | PASS |
+| `bun run templates:check` | PASS |
+| Foundation UI project `assembleDebug` + lint | PASS |
+EOF
+wc -c docs/phases/F1.4-foundation.md
